 "name_zh": "波尔托湾：皮亚纳－卡兰切斯、基罗拉塔湾、斯康多拉保护区",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Gulf of Porto: Calanche of Piana, Gulf of Girolata, Scandola Reserve",
 "name_local": "Golfe de Porto : calanche de Piana, golfe de Girolata, réserve de Scandola",
